<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Renters Choice rated a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Renters Choice rated a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Mesirow Financial on Tuesday said it rated Renters Choice Inc a Focus Buy, with a 12-month target price of $24.25 a share.</p>
<p>-- Renters Choice is expected to achieve 30-percent earnings growth over the next three years, predicted Mesirow. Renters is the nation's second-largest rent-to-own company with 653 stores.</p>
<p>-- Renters Choice stock was up 1-1/4 at 19-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdeak (312) 408-8787</p>
</text>
